{
  "_readme": "Look library for scenario-video-color-grade. Keys sort the outputs. 'ops' = per-pixel color (baked into a LUT); 'relight' = spatial light ops; 'selective' = keyed B&W + one color (tune per clip with inspect_frame.py key); vignette/grain/halation = finishing. 'match' looks need stats from match.py (paths resolve next to this file).",
